      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>The weakest of the bulette family, this armor-plated creature roams in packs of two to four.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 21, touch 11; flat-footed 19 (+2 dex, +10 natural, -1 size)</p><p>hp 66 [91] (7d8+35)</p><p>Fort +9, Ref +7, Will +5</p><p>Defensive Abilities Spines; Resist Earth 5</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 30 ft.</p><p>Melee 2 Claws +9 (1d8+5), Bite +10 (2d6+7/19-20)</p><p>Space 10 ft.; Reach 10 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Leap, Savage Bite</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 20, Dex 15, Con 18, Int 2, Wis 12, Cha 6</p><p>Base Atk +5; CMB +11; CMD 23 (27 vs. trip)</p><p>Feats Improved Initiative, Iron Will, Toughness, Weapon Focus (Bite)</p><p>Skills Acrobatics +7 (+15 jumping), Perception +6, Racial Modifiers +8 on Acrobatics checks made to jump</p>"
